            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Congress created the United States Trustee Program to transfer administrative functions from bankruptcy judges to U.S. Trustees, a component of the Department of Justice."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "775a8ddc68188e880d9592028b515d07bfe207f528fb350a5874477ec3e08c08",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-775a8ddc6818-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court was asked to decide whether the 2017 Act\u2019s fee increase violates the uniformity requirement of the Bankruptcy Clause."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "case_id": "2021-21-441",
  "decision": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "775a8ddc68188e880d9592028b515d07bfe207f528fb350a5874477ec3e08c08",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-775a8ddc6818-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 18,
              "start": 18
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the Bankruptcy Clause prohibits Congress from arbitrarily dividing states into categories and charging different fees unrelated to the needs or conditions of those states."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "775a8ddc68188e880d9592028b515d07bfe207f528fb350a5874477ec3e08c08",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-775a8ddc6818-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The judgment of the Fourth Circuit was reversed and the case was remanded for further proceedings consistent with this opinion."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Decision",
