              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked whether the problem was the fees themselves, the differential fees, or the original division of the country into two types of districts."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d43168ea462a3a142b9fb28e1a3be537a6e08ce881fe6ef12ab3dfe3fa40feba",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d43168ea462a-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts noted that the districts were being treated differently."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d43168ea462a3a142b9fb28e1a3be537a6e08ce881fe6ef12ab3dfe3fa40feba",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d43168ea462a-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked for examples of cases that go the farthest in declaring non\u2011uniformity unconstitutional in bankruptcy."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d43168ea462a3a142b9fb28e1a3be537a6e08ce881fe6ef12ab3dfe3fa40feba",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d43168ea462a-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor expressed difficulty with establishing a broad rule in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d43168ea462a3a142b9fb28e1a3be537a6e08ce881fe6ef12ab3dfe3fa40feba",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d43168ea462a-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked what the framers\u2019 concern was when they wrote the Bankruptcy Clause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d43168ea462a3a142b9fb28e1a3be537a6e08ce881fe6ef12ab3dfe3fa40feba",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d43168ea462a-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked what legal standard governs the issue of \u201cleveling up or leveling down.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d43168ea462a3a142b9fb28e1a3be537a6e08ce881fe6ef12ab3dfe3fa40feba",
            "evidence_ids": [
